 India are eligible to apply.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSC Engineering Services Pre Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSC Engineering Services Mains Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their UPSC Engineering Services Mains Admit Card candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates are required to click it for downloading their UPSC Engineering Services Mains Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to the login page, here they need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Have to Click on the “Login” tab.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their UPSC Engineerin